{
  "decision": "NO_CHANGE",
  "workflow_yaml": null,
  "rationale": "No supported optimization is safe to apply to this workflow. P-LIT-GHA-CACHE (dependency caching) is contraindicated because every job already uses actions/setup-node@v4 with cache: pnpm, which is an equivalent dependency cache; adding another cache would be redundant. P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT is not supported: the repository CI history has no completed runs, so the precondition for representative successful-duration history is unmet, and the e2e-tests job installs Playwright Chromium with dependencies, a valid slow run likely to exceed a short fixed timeout (the pattern's contraindication: valid slow runs exceed the proposed limit). P-LIT-FAIL-FAST does not apply because there are no matrix jobs. Workflow-level concurrency with cancel-in-progress: true is already present, covering stale-run cancellation. Change-aware filtering or step skipping is not supported because required checks span shared configuration and the example app depends on the build artifact, so path-based skipping could hide failures and weaken required-check coverage.",
  "evidence_ids": ["P-LIT-GHA-CACHE", "P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT"]
}
